  detailed_description: 'W1 is the simplest tool steel (high-carbon plain carbon steel) with shallow hardenability. Cross-section preparation reveals a hard martensitic case, a transition zone, and a soft pearlitic core, making it an ideal demonstration of hardenability concepts.',
