  typical_uses: '[Automotive gear nitriding QC,Crankshaft case depth verification,Injection mold surface hardening,Die casting die surface treatment]',
  detailed_description: 'Nitrided steel cross-sections reveal a compound (white) layer of iron nitrides and a nitrogen diffusion zone over a tempered martensite core. Case depth measurement by microhardness traverse per ASTM E384 is the primary quality control task.',
