  detailed_description: 'TiCN-Ni cermet is a titanium carbonitride-based hard material lighter than WC-Co with superior chemical wear resistance. The characteristic core-rim grain structure is the primary microstructural feature for quality assessment. Diamond preparation is mandatory.',
