  applications: '[Container glass,Float glass,Automotive glazing,Fiber optics (failure analysis)]',
  typical_uses: '[Windshield failure analysis,Float glass coating evaluation,Bottle defect analysis,Glass fiber cross-section]',
  detailed_description: 'Soda-lime glass is an amorphous material with no crystalline microstructure. Cross-section preparation serves coating analysis, lamination evaluation, surface defect characterization, and fracture analysis. Very brittle; chips easily during grinding.',
  status: 'published',
